    "description": "Operational settings so Ops knows how to handle this Operator day to day.\n\n=== FIELDS ===\n\n* Tracking Benchmark — Percent, manual entry. Joyce: 'someone will have to manually monitor and update because we don't have the operator data yet... it's just going to be a percentage field for now.'\n\n* Benchmark Last Reviewed — Date, auto-stamped by the flow in BUILD-146\n\n* RG Language — Long Text Area — responsible-gaming copy used to keep the agency sites compliant\n\n* Operational Notes — Long Text Area\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* No Redirect Destination / default redirect URL on Operator. Removed Aug 13 — it lives on Deal. Kobi: 'I wonder if it's better to just go straight to deal and not operator.' Emily: 'I don't even remember adding this.' Joyce: 'Take it out.' See BUILD-155.\n\n* No 'Last Reviewed By' field — Emily declined, system audit trail covers it.\n\n* On the Aug 17 call the Management Details section was found floating outside the Details tab and dragged inside it. Sections must be dragged into a tab or they render outside it.\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* ALREADY BUILT — confirmed on the Aug 17 Kobi/Taryn call. Ticket is retroactive documentation. Set Status = Ready for Review and add the real API names to the card so the work is traceable.\n\n* Provenance: OP-2, minus the redirect field.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Taryn doc OP-2\n\n* Aug 13 call\n\n* Aug 17 call — section moved into Details tab\n\nDependencies: BUILD-126\n\nOwner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nCreated 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
